{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"dongyuan-p0038","name":"陈球","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o073"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"dongyuan-m-o073-dongyuan-p0038","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o073"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-q-o073","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-e6baa7c37f2b8d81088f","layer":"original","quote":"时沛相下邳陈珪〖2〗，故太尉球弟子也〖3〗。术与珪俱公族子孙〖4〗，少共交游。书与珪曰：“昔秦失其政，天下群雄，争而取之，兼智勇者卒受其归〖5〗。今世事纷扰，复有瓦解之势矣；诚英乂有为之时也〖6〗。与足下旧交，岂肯左右之乎？若集大事，子实为吾心膂〖7〗。”珪中子应，时在下邳；术并胁质应，图必致珪。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":149}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
